OL,3,ALast call for the mall? How shopping
OL,4,Acentres are reinventing themselves
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Brunel Centre was once a thriving
OL,7,Fretail destination, attracting shoppers
OL,8,Ffrom far and wide.
OL,10,F"It was incredible," says town
OL,11,Fcouncillor Keith Ely, who remembers its
OL,12,Fopening in Bletchley, Buckinghamshire,
OL,13,Fin 1973.
OL,15,FBack then, centre:MK, a large
OL,16,Fdestination shopping centre four miles
OL,17,Faway in Milton Keynes, did not exist,
OL,18,Fand the Brunel was quite the draw.
OL,20,FNow, like many other medium-sized
OL,21,Fshopping centres, it is struggling.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
